From 655e49b689f572c25adca8b048e86b7aedc6fcee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Muhomor <muhomor.dmitry@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Feb 2023 19:44:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 08/15] add base classes for {Bool,Int}Setting preference
 controllers

If no customization is needed, BoolSetting base class can be used directly from XML by adding
settings:boolSettingField="<class name> <BoolSetting field name>"
to the preference XML definition.

(cherry picked from commit e32073ab2f9361571b728e2a4670367facd9fbe6)
---
